<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψηφ-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		aor.
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψᾱφίξαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put to the vote,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν γνώμαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).249.38
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Anaphe</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ.
				τοὺς φόρους</span>
			<i>keep account of</i> tribute, of the <i>rationales,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> more freq.
				Dep.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψηφίζομαι,</span>
			
				Att.
			
			fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιοῦμαι,</span>
			<i>vote by ballot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Eux.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. περὶ δίκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					937a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κρύβδην, κρύφα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				And.
				4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.88
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>decide by vote,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				26.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύτῃ διαψηφίσασθε</span>
			v.l.in
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				28.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαψηφισθεὶς εἰ γνήσιός ἐστι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Decl.</u>
					16.29
				</span></i>
			.</div>
